    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "As a window of opportunity created by the changing season appeared, more individuals faced enforcement actions in the U.S.-Mexico border region. The agency responsible for border security reported a rise in apprehensions, yet lawmakers remain deadlocked on funding. This inaction leaves migrants facing perilous journeys without adequate support, highlighting a political impasse that delays critical resources for those in vulnerable circumstances.",
